    {
      "id": "PSM-02",
      "chapter": "lifts",
      "anchor": "lifts-parabolic-haar-density",
      "title": "A weighted product of Haar measures on the parabolic subgroup",
      "hypotheses": "The measurable coordinates of the line stabilizer, additive Haar in b,z, left Haar on the two Levi factors and normalized local absolute values.",
      "statement": "With χ defined by pushforward under (b,z) ↦ (ā b,aā z), the density χ(a) relative to idèle Haar makes the product left invariant. The product has positive mass on identity neighbourhoods and finite mass on compact sets.",
